"# Riddler Go

> Riddler Go is a web platform for hosting interactive puzzle events. Guests join with a QR code; no accounts, no downloads.

Hosts author events with puzzles and hints.

Participants race a live leaderboard.

- [Site](https://riddlergo.com/)
- [Index](https://riddlergo.com/llms.txt)
- [Sitemap](https://riddlergo.com/sitemap.xml)

## How it works

Source: https://riddlergo.com/how-it-works

1. **Build**: Add puzzles and hints.
2. **Share**: Send the QR code.
3. **Watch**: Follow the live leaderboard.

## Pricing

Source: https://riddlergo.com/pricing

### Free: Free

One event at a time.

### Pro: $29/month

Unlimited events.

- Custom branding
- CSV export

### Event pass: $49.50 one-time

Prices in US dollars.

